PROJECT STATUS
==============

YETI is currently at Version 0.2 (Alpha). The core architecture and VFS
layer are functional, but the project is ON HOLD.

Active development is paused because the author is currently focused on
"Projekt Helix" — an x86-to-ARM binary translator.

The code is released as-is. There is no active roadmap, no guaranteed
bugfixes, and no support commitment. Contributions are welcome but may
not be reviewed or merged promptly.

The author reserves the right to resume development, relicense, or
abandon the project at any time.
